{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577080/extras/6cfdcd0e29254a61ec514310834cb975.poster.avif?t=1771935631\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577080/extras/6cfdcd0e29254a61ec514310834cb975.webm?t=1771935631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577080/extras/6cfdcd0e29254a61ec514310834cb975.mp4?t=1771935631\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577080/extras/588d885af67c4f65c4d8b18be5c6e976.avif?t=1771935631\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577080/extras_big/588d885af67c4f65c4d8b18be5c6e976.webp?t=1771935631 width=1560 height=223 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>My Dear Emma</i> is a heartfelt narrative adventure that intertwines the emotional journey of Emma, a young biologist and photographer with the enduring legacy of her late grandfather. Inspired by real-life stories, this deeply personal tale invites players to uncover memories, family secrets, and reflections on love, loss, and the ties that shape us.    <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577080/extras/282ba78e46ed68735280013caba85614.avif?t=1771935631\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577080/extras_big/282ba78e46ed68735280013caba85614.webp?t=1771935631 width=1560 height=223 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After inheriting her grandparents\u2019 old house, Emma returns to the countryside to begin a new chapter in her life while unraveling the emotional threads of her past.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a beautifully crafted world seen through Emma\u2019s eyes, where exploration of intimate moments blends seamlessly with powerful themes such as sustainability and animal welfare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577080/extras/a7944fccce8becbf7bdbca1a583a50d7.avif?t=1771935631\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577080/extras_big/a7944fccce8becbf7bdbca1a583a50d7.webp?t=1771935631 width=1560 height=223 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>My Dear Emma</i> is a journey of emotional connection, personal growth, and everyday life. It offers a rare balance between heartfelt storytelling and meaningful real-world issues. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emotional, character-driven narrative inspired by true events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stunning, atmospheric environments rich with detail</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration of vital topics: sustainability, animal welfare, climate change</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique blend of storytelling, education, and personal reflection</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you so much! Your wishlist truly helps this project. We\u2019re a small, diverse, and multicultural indie studio from Frankfurt, Germany \ud83c\udde9\ud83c\uddea.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2577080?t=1771935631","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577080/9318c0c42e801f89248c533e9b893000530cc4ba/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771935631","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577080/6f4006f328083432d80e7efd0202a9a789c